_transcripts"},{"c":"HWM 2021 Q4","e":"hwm","d":"2022-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Giacobbe","x":"Approximately $28 million of the $31 million revenue increase was due to higher aluminum price pass-through.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HWM 2021 Q4","e":"hwm","d":"2022-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Giacobbe","x":"As a result of restructuring our accounts receivable securitization program in Q3 2021, cash receipts from sold receivables will be zero going forward and the entire impact from the sale of accounts receivables will be in cash from operations.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HWM 2021 Q4","e":"hwm","d":"2022-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Plant","x":"The most important thing is that despite all and within that output, containing that through our cost reduction programs and our efficiency, despite all of the impact of Omicron and that production disruption that it did provide.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HWM 2022 Q1","e":"hwm","d":"2022-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Plant","x":"Revenue for the quarter was 1.3 billion, an increase of 10% year-over-year, which includes additional material pass-through of approximately $40 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HWM 2022 Q1","e":"hwm","d":"2022-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Plant","x":"Clearly, this pass-through is excellent.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"HWM 2022 Q1","e":"hwm","d":"2022-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Plant","x":"And essentially, that has taken down the total number of 787 aircraft produced this year from, I think, 35 down to 24 or 25, something like that, and taking that revenue hit, but as you see, maintained our guide